From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:45:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCodec: keep the picture for a next decoder of the same
 format

A decoder close unregisters the video layer with blackout, so the
screen is black from the end of one item until the first frame of the
next, even when both play the same format. A held output is kept even
when the next item is known to be of another HDR type.
